WEBVTT

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.880
This is my first time entering.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.820
Fingers crossed...

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.650
I'm so nervous!

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.420
New Project
Designer
<Yagami Ko>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.760
I'm starting to get nervous...

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.200
Who drew this?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.460
It was me.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.140
Yagami Ko. You're the new hire
 from last month, aren't you?

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.340
All right. I've made my choice.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:35.760
You'll be in charge of the new project's 
character designs, Yagami-kun.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.440
<b>The character design competition has begun!!</b>

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.440
<b>
Feel free to draw
what you want, meow</b>

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:13.320
The character design 
competition's finally begun!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.820
First, read the design document 
Hazuki-san and her design team drew up

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.750
and take inspiration from that.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.410
They're using one of my ideas, too!

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.110
Though it's not a huge part.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.040
That's amazing!

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.690
Huh? Then are you joinin' the design team?

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:32.360
Nah, I'm staying with the motion team. 
I'll be helping with both.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:34.720
W-Wow, that's impressive.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:36.580
I believe in you!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.960
Thanks!

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:43.930
So it's an action game where you advance 
by beating the floors of each dungeon.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.390
By absorbing the animals and 
monsters that are in the dungeons,

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.010
you can gain their special abilities.

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.310
I see.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:58.280
"You can use fire to lure your enemies 
to one location to farm XP."

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.610
"Then obliterate them with your ultimate!"

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.950
"Ultimate attack: Red Phantom!"

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.840
How fun! It's so your style, Hajime-san!

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.050
Red Phantom?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.700
See, they just finally glimpsed

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:14.510
all my passion and talent 
that's bursting to get out!

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.290
Oh.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.530
Red phantom's the name of a tropical fish.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:20.290
But there's nothing written 
about what kind of setting this is.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.130
No way!

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:24.280
You didn't even read the whole document?

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:30.290
Apparently, other than the battle system, 
we're free to design however we like.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:33.870
D-Does that mean they're 
just dumping the work on us?

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.190
It means that they have faith in us!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.790
Anyway, the first competition is in a week.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.820
Be sure to enter if you're interested.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.030
Got it!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.250
U-Um...

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.590
You're going to enter the 
competition, too, right?

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.290
Of course!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.110
I wonder what I should draw!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.220
You sure seem determined, Aoba-chan.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.100
I am!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:10.220
Being a character designer 
has always been my dream!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.070
But, I mean, isn't Yagami-san 
gonna get chosen anyway?

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.500
She's super talented.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:21.630
This competition's just 
so that no one can complain.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:24.990
But it's a foregone conclusion.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.160
That may be true.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:34.330
But I'm fine with failure, 
so long as I know the results were deserved.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.830
Are you going to enter, Yun-san?

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.420
Huh? Me?

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.780
I'm not that good, and I know 
I won't make the cut, so I'll pass.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.680
I see...

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.710
What about you, Hifumi-senpai?

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.690
I want to concentrate... on 3D modeling...

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.390
So...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.980
I'll look forward to your 
designs... Aoba-chan.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.320
I'll do my best.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.840
Absorbing enemies...

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.530
Absorbing animals, huh...

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.330
Hm...

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:13.080
Absorb a dog and... woof, woof!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.460
Absorb a cow and... moo, moo.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.960
Absorb a cat and... meow, meow!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.020
That's all wrong!

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.420
This is just turning into cos-purr-lay!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.130
<i>Is she going to be okay?</i>

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.810
I can't think of anything...

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.140
Let's see how my competition is doing!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.140
Yagami-san, how are things...

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.350
Hm?

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:38.270
<i>That was fast!</i>

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.980
Th-That's amazing. You've 
already designed this many?

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.940
Well, character design has been 
my job for a while now.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.310
Would you mind if I had a look?

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:49.830
Sure, go ahead.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.230
<i>She really is amazing.</i>

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:54.770
<i>And yet...</i>

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.500
<i>It's her art, which I've always loved.</i>

00:05:58.760 --> 00:05:59.800
<i>How come now...</i>

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.750
<i>...it makes me feel...</i>

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.500
<i>...so inadequate?</i>

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:12.520
<i>Maybe it really is a foregone conclusion.</i>

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.520
<i>No! I'm supposed to be enjoying this!</i>

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.520
Thank you very much!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.780
I guess I'm going to have to try harder.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.270
R-Right...

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.790
Morning, Aoba-chan...

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.710
What's wrong?

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:51.740
Oh, I'm fine! I sort of 
overdid it yesterday...

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:57.470
<i>Did Hajime-san sacrifice sleep 
working on her first design job?</i>

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:01.960
<i>Must be!</i>

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.230
<i>I started watching 
</i>Dandy Max Returns<i> last night...</i>

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.240
<i>and ended up binge watching all night.</i>

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.740
<i>I'm back!</i>

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.660
<i>Follow me, guys!</i>

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:22.150
<i>The best part about Dandy is how 
good-for-nothing but passionate he is.</i>

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.700
She must be tired from her design work.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.640
I figured she was the type 
to give her all, but...

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:33.290
Hajime-chan's... working hard 
to make up for the late design work...

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.850
I didn't think she was the 
responsible type, to be honest.

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:40.600
I just gotta get through today.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.030
Hajime.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.920
Yes! I'm so sorry!

00:07:56.920 --> 00:08:00.520
If you're that tired, you'll be more 
productive if you take a little nap.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:03.030
R-Right...

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.030
Hajime-chan...

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:06.790
Yes?

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:10.300
Chocolate Variety Pack

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:10.300
Want something... sweet?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.040
Oh, thank you very—

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.550
Whoa!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.050
Thanks...

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:21.940
<i>Everyone's being super nice 
to me for some reason.</i>

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.460
<i>I-Is it because I'm such a good person?!</i>

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.990
What should we have for lunch today?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.670
Well, why don't we go all-out 
and have pork cutlets?

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.200
<i>I somehow made it through the morning...</i>

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:42.160
Sure seems like someone 
could use the energy.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:47.980
<i>Did Yun, the calorie-counting health nut, 
really just say that?</i>

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.090
<i>A pork cutlet place?!</i>

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:53.320
Building something from scratch is so hard.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:56.190
Your whole thought process is different...

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.850
It's hard to know where to start.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:03.480
It's always difficult... 
trying something new...

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:04.620
Huh?!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.980
We're rootin' for you.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.730
U-Um, actually...

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:14.740
Hm?

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:18.620
The reason I looked drained this morning...

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:22.760
was that I started rewatching <i>Dandy</i>...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.500
and didn't get enough sleep...

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:27.970
Um...

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.750
I'll work harder.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:38.970
Hajime!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.850
We were just talking about you.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.690
We're excited to see what you think up!

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:52.040
R-Right... I'll do my best.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:00.950
Tomorrow's the deadline!

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:05.200
Say, Mr. Eraser, you got any good ideas?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:09.710
You're barking up the wrong tree, Mr. Pencil.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:15.070
It's your job to come up with ideas 
and mine to correct and erase them.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:20.720
If you're going to be so rigid, maybe we 
need to round out your edges a bit more!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.640
Hrgh! Stop!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.890
Take this, and this...

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:27.980
Argh! Stop!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.270
Now's not the time for this.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.150
I might have to stay overnight to 
prepare for the competition tomorrow...

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:56.210
All right. Let's get 
this design competition started.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:59.130
First, let's see what Yagami has for us.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:00.860
Got it.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.080
We're presenting 
in front of all these people?

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:09.060
Yup. Anyone from the team 
is free to participate.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:14.300
I went with a fantasy theme 
to allow for more free-form action,

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:18.620
with weapons and armor that 
can change, grow, and evolve.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:16.730
<b>Skeleton</b>

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.090
<b>Ox</b>

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:19.190
<b>Snake</b>

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:25.780
Fantastic as usual, Yagami. I love your work.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:31.250
<b>Wolf</b>

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:31.250
The thing is, the world you've created 
is no different from <i>Fairies</i>.

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:32.580
Huh?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:37.090
We're looking more for you 
to develop your own vision.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.850
So... they're all rejected?

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:41.600
It's a shame,

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:45.890
but we want you to experiment more because 
we're giving you so much freedom.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:52.310
That level of work was rejected? 
This is harder than I thought.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:56.580
Yeah... But it looks like 
they have high hopes for Yagami-san.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.520
You're next, Suzukaze-kun.

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:01.290
Huh? Oh, okay!

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:08.910
<i>Suzukaze-kun's are similar to </i>Fairies<i>, too.</i>

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:11.810
<i>Perhaps she's trying too hard 
to be the next Yagami.</i>

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.810
Impenetrable Turtle!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:16.170
Bear!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:16.170
Bear!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.170
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:26.180
Bear!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:26.180
Bear!

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.660
Oh, I'm sorry! This is something 
I drew based on my sleeping bag!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.180
It's just a doodle!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:29.200
But I thought it could be interesting...

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.630
I see.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.060
True, it is interesting.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.230
Although, here, the character's 
the one getting absorbed.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.440
I know, right?

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:44.490
I've made my choice.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:47.150
Of course... Huh? You're kidding.

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:49.850
Obviously, we can't use this as-is,

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:53.000
so could you polish it up 
by the next competition?

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.620
We'll decide from there.

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.630
O-Okay!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.610
Great job, Aoba-chan!

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:00.470
Congratulations...

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:02.460
Hang on! Nothing's final yet.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.420
But I'll do my best!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:10.970
Bear!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:10.970
Bear!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.230
That concludes the first competition.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.230
The second competition will be next week.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.980
Those who received 
direction from me, follow it.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:25.940
Any newcomers who now want to 
participate are free to do so, as well.

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.740
Oh, Yagami-san—

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:35.900
Hm? What's up?

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:36.870
Oh, uh...

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.510
It's nothing...

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.020
This is so hard!

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:52.890
What can I do to make it better?

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:04.400
It'll be fine.

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.540
Yagami-san's a nice person.

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.910
Um... Yagami-san?

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:17.820
I'm having trouble with the designs,

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:20.050
so I was hoping to get some advice...

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:21.130
Oh...

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:25.860
But I guess you haven't 
gotten anywhere yet, either.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.130
"Yet"?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.890
<i>All</i> of my designs were just rejected.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.680
You think I'll come up with 
something new so quickly?!

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:41.060
I'm sorry...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.060
N-No...

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.750
It's my own fault. I'm sorry.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:48.070
I'll try and work it out on my own.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:09.080
<i>I'm glad my designs were approved, 
even if it's not for certain yet.</i>

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:16.140
<i>But... if my designs end 
up getting final approval...</i>

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.310
<i>Yagami-san would...</i>

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:28.530
<i>Was this really... 
the dream that I longed for?</i>

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.450
Aoba-chan.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.530
Congrats on earlier. Keep at it!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:39.080
Oh... Thank you very much!

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:43.480
You know, to tell you the truth...

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:48.640
When I saw you working so hard 
despite knowing you'd fail,

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:51.170
I thought you were 
making a fool of yourself.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.750
The same thing with Hajime.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.910
Her proposal had no chance of going through,

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:59.310
so I thought she was foolish 
for even making one.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:03.720
Before I knew it, I was the only 
one that hadn't done anything.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.860
I made the biggest fool of myself.

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:08.490
Yun-san...

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.240
I'm off to a bit of a late start,

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.340
but I'm thinkin' about entering 
the next competition, too.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:19.520
I probably don't stand a chance 
since I never really push myself.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.250
But I'll try my best!

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:28.280
So forgive me for thinking 
you were making a fool of yourself.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:31.370
P-Please, don't worry about it!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:37.170
But don't tell Hajime! 
I'd die if she knew.

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.520
You should just be more honest.

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.940
But, that's right...

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:47.750
This was supposed to be what I wanted.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:53.700
I joined this company because 
I admired Yagami-san so much...

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:56.870
I was satisfied just being able...

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.710
...to work under Yagami-san...

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:08.850
I never wanted to see her
looking like that...

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:12.860
Uh, Aoba-chan...?

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.490
There you are.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.390
So...

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:52.460
I ended up taking out my frustration on Aoba.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.010
I know. I saw.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.510
That hit me harder than what 
happened at the competition.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.020
I'm so pathetic...

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:11.990
Remember the competition right 
around when we joined the company,

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:14.890
where you were chosen as character designer?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.470
Are you saying it's the same as that?

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:21.620
You're right.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.290
Now I'm the evil senpai.

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:27.190
And that's why...

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:34.800
That's why, if anyone knows what they 
should do for Aoba-chan right now,

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.690
it's you, Ko-chan.

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:43.430
What do you want Aoba-chan 
to get out of this?

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.250
That's something only you can decide.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.570
So you're dumping the job on me.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.420
Not at all.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:02.030
The Ko-chan I know will 
make the right decision.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:24.760
Aoba!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:30.110
H-Hello...

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:33.290
You said you were having 
trouble with your designs earlier.

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:34.520
Let me have a look.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:35.590
Huh?

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.780
Oh, sure!

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:47.740
You weren't kidding about having trouble...

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:52.010
First off... Can I draw on this?

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:54.310
Oh, sure. Go ahead.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.370
This part was fine, so...

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:25.070
What? Is there something on my face?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.030
N-No!

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:28.730
It's nothing.

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:33.830
This is supposed to be your design, 
so don't expect me to draw it all!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.790
I know that!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:42.820
The girl will wait for the perfect chance
to take over the plushie's body

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.820
Why don't we make it so she gets 
different abilities depending
on what plushies are taken over?

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.200
The enemies will be plushies, toys, etc.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.200
So cute!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:47.300
A normal Westerner girl
is what we're thinking for the protagonist

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.850
Which one of you drew this?

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:00.120
Yagami-san gave me advice,

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:03.720
and helped me draw the parts 
I just couldn't get to look balanced.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.600
But it's mostly Aoba's design.

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:09.170
But if Yagami-san hadn't helped me, 
I never could have...

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:12.020
Whereas I never would have had the ideas...

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:14.370
All right, I get it...

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.320
This is very interesting indeed.

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:21.130
Yes. I think it's great.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:23.470
Let's use this for the prototype.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:28.870
Both of you are to finalize 
the character designs together.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:33.310
But as AD, Yagami will have 
the final say on decisions.

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:39.060
Are our producers okay with that?

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:41.730
Yes.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:54.330
In that case, 
Yagami Ko and Suzukaze Aoba-kun...

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:59.830
I look forward to having 
you both as character designers.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.340
Thank you!
